wa-gakambe-aidiku (130) nanaed.","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Degine, nog-dummad gwa-gwagwengi, mani-dulapaa-gakambe-aidiku (70) nanaed.","poem":2},{"text":"Bela batemar, degine, nogmar, Bab-Dummadse-goled-neggi mani-aidikued-ebislegedyobi, mani-nibir-milibo gaka dulataled-ilabake-aidiku (2,400) daklealid.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":86,"content":[{"text":"Or-wesar-warambe-gakabo (12) egi ina-wawadikid-ena-senonimaladi, a-or-wesar-ga-gagwengi mani-ambe-aidiku (10) nanaed.","poem":2},{"text":"Bela or-wesar Bab-Dummadse-goled-neggi mani-aidikued-ebislegedyobi, mani-nibir-dulanergwa-aidikue (120) gussundo.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":87,"content":[{"text":"Bab-Jehováʼga ibdurgan-ogumakar-ukega senonimaladdina, weyob mergued:","poem":1},{"text":"Molimar-bebe-nikmalad-sapingwagwad, warambe-gakabo (12),","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"sibad-wawaad-machered, warambe-gakabo (12),","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"sibad-wawaad-sapingwagwad-birgagwen-nikad, warambe-gakabo (12).","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"We-sibad-wawaad-birgagwenadba ibmar-gwag-ukleged senonimarbalid.","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Degine, isgued-eliega sibad-machered, warambe-gakabo (12) senonimarbalid.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":88,"content":[{"text":"Gwenatigwar-guega, ibdurgan-senonimalad, weyob mergued:","poem":1},{"text":"Molimar-bebe-nikad-alugwasuarmalad, waladulagwen-gakabake (24),","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"sibad-wawaad-machered, waladulapaa (60),","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"sibad-machered, waladulapaa (60),","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"degine, sibad-wawaad-sapingwagwad-birgagwen-nikad, waladulapaa (60) mergued.","poem":2},{"text":"We-ibmarmala ibmar-ogumakar-ukleged-aila-nug-imaklenaigusgu Bab-Jehováʼga uklesad.","poem":3}]},{"type":"heading","content":["Bab-Jehová Moisés-ebo-sunmaksad"]},{"type":"verse","number":89,"content":["Moisés Bab-Jehová-ebo-sunmakega, Bab-Jehová-dulemarbo-ambikued-negse dogdegu, Moisés, Bab-Jehová-ega-sunmake itosad. Bab-Jehová-Dulemarbo-Igar-Mesisad-Ulu-e-atued-birgi, baliwitur-warbo-querubinʼye-nugad-gwichimalad-imbagi ega sunmake itosad. Weyobi, Bab-Jehová Moisés-ebo sunmakdaed."]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cuk_nvs/NUM/7.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cuk_nvs/NUM/8.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cuk_nvs/NUM/6.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":89}